From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:58:33 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] libbluray: run the BD-J media time on the presented clock

The BD-J media time of a playlist runs on the wall clock from the
playback start or seek. It keeps counting while the player is paused
or stalled, so it drifts from the picture on screen and runs past the
end of the playlist.
